{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ4ujXLXYysj2hS9z3rq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't get a figure for Shift4's (FOUR) vendor concentration risk as of December 31, 2024 with these tools.\n\n**What the tools did show:**\n- **The relevant filing is the FY2024 10-K.** It was filed on 19 February 2025 for the period ending 31 December 2024. Full-text searches found that it uses terms like \"vendor\", \"limited number of\" suppliers or vendors, \"third-party vendors\" and \"sole/single source\". So the 10-K does talk about relying on vendors, probably in the risk factors.\n- **There's no structured data for it.** Shift4 doesn't report `ConcentrationRiskPercentage1`; the lookup returned a 404. None of the XBRL data Shift4 reports has \"concentration\" or \"vendor\" in its name. That means there's no tagged figure such as \"X% of purchases from one vendor.\"\n\n**What was missing:** The search tool only says which filings contain a word, not the text around it, and no tool here can open the filing itself. So I can't tell you what the 10-K says about vendor concentration: which vendors it names, whether it gives any percentages, or whether the mentions are only general risk wording.\n\nTo get the answer, read the 10-K at the link below. Search inside it for \"vendor\", \"sole source\" and \"concentration\", mainly in Item 1A (Risk Factors) and the notes to the financial statements on concentration of risk.\n\n**Sources**\n- Shift4 Payments, Inc. Form 10-K for FY2024, filed 2025-02-19, accession 0001794669-25-000011 (https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1794669/000179466925000011/four-20241231.htm). Only the fact that it matched the search terms was confirmed; its text wasn't available.\n- SEC XBRL company facts for CIK 0001794669: no concentration-risk or vendor data reported."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":539,"cache_read_input_tokens":10122,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":539},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eaa7b0e4-ffb4-4cb4-afa7-2458c41d155b","uuid":"361fdc1d-a2a2-4934-a1af-b8cc5d401b7f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:34:56.414Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ4ujFUZ4YeeVWCai5pd"}
